    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="84">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 84</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Nu bidde ic georne ⁊ on Godes naman beode manna gehwylcne, þæt he inweardre heortan gebuga to his Drihtene, ⁊ oft ⁊ gelome smeage hwæt him sy to donne ⁊ hwæt to forganne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Now I earnestly entreat all men and command them, in the name of God, to submit in their inmost hearts to their lord, and often and frequently consider what they ought to do and what they ought to forgo.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Nu bidde ic georne – ⁊ on Godes naman beode – manna gehwylcne, þæt he inweardre heortan gebuge to his Drihtne ⁊ oft ⁊ gelome smeage swyðe georne, hwæt him sig to donne ⁊ hwæt to forganne.</ab>
      </div>
